# Credential inventory — machine-readable expiry tracking. The prose runbook
# (per-key fan-out + exact rotation commands) lives in agent_docs/secrets.md;
# this file is what check-key-expiry.sh parses.
#
# Columns (pipe-separated, fields trimmed):
#   name     stable identifier
#   type     credential kind
#   expires  YYYY-MM-DD | none (non-expiring) | unknown (date not yet recorded
#            — fill in; the checker lists unknowns but does not alarm on them)
#   op-ref   1Password item (op://<vault>/<item>[/<field>] @ <account>), or
#            `-` if the secret is not stored in 1Password
#   fanout   comma-separated deployment targets (where rotation must propagate)
#
# Checked monthly by check-key-expiry.sh (launchd:
# com.kylelundstedt.check-key-expiry). Update `expires` on every rotation.

tailscale-oauth-client | oauth-client (auth_keys+devices:core write, tag:dev) | none | op://Employee/Tailscale OAuth Dev @ industryvault.1password.com | exe.dev:tailscale-api (Basic header), install.sh (mini join + VM join), test-install.sh, join-tailnet/upgrade-vm skills
github-pat-home | github-fine-grained-pat | unknown | op://Private/GitHub PAT Home/token @ lundstedts.1password.com | claude-mcp:github-home(macOS), gh-auth(headless fallback), exe.dev:github-mcp-home
github-pat-iv | github-fine-grained-pat | unknown | op://Employee/GitHub PAT IV/token @ industryvault.1password.com | claude-mcp:github-work(macOS), keychain:sync-repos:IndustryVault, exe.dev:github-mcp-work
github-pat-iv-cmg | github-fine-grained-pat | unknown | op://Employee/GitHub PAT IV-CMG/token @ industryvault.1password.com | keychain:sync-repos:iv-cmg
tigris-backup-rclone-key | s3-access-key | none | op://Personal/Tigris mini-backup rclone key @ industryvault.1password.com | keychain:tigris-backup:s3-key-id,keychain:tigris-backup:s3-secret
tigris-backup-crypt | rclone-crypt-password+salt | none | op://Personal/Tigris mini-backup rclone crypt @ industryvault.1password.com | keychain:tigris-backup:crypt-password,keychain:tigris-backup:crypt-salt
owc8tb-passphrase | disk-encryption-passphrase | none | op://Personal/OWC8TB disk encryption/password @ industryvault.1password.com | keychain:owc8tb-encryption
healthchecks-api-key | api-key (read-write) | none | - | keychain:healthchecks:api-key (mini) — manages check configs; created 2026-07-13
